Confirm or revert a pending connectivity change

Usage:
  olr recovery [command]

Available Commands:
  confirm     Keep a connectivity change after checking access
  revert      Restore the configuration before a connectivity change
  status      Show the connectivity confirmation deadline

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for recovery

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr recovery [command] --help" for more information about a command.
